- the audit records the device id;
- brute-force pairing is rate-limited;
- no secret appears in logs (redaction). In-flight conflicts: Protected server.ts and new protected modules (after MOB-15). Protected files: apps/control-api/src/server.ts, config/validation.json, config/trust-root-manifest.json.

